      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">PRIVATE TRUST & CYBER DEFENSE</div>
            <h1>Luxury-grade security for digital confidence.</h1>
            <p>
              Aurelia Security delivers disciplined protection for high-value systems,
