        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow alt">Platform</span>
            <h2>Security designed for high-value digital operations.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="card-grid">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-index">01</div>
              <h3>Threat Intelligence</h3>
              <p>Real-time awareness of emerging risk patterns, adversary behavior, and critical exposure shifts.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-index">02</div>
              <h3>Identity Assurance</h3>
              <p>Privileged access discipline, MFA enforcement, and secure access patterns for sensitive systems.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-index">03</div>
              <h3>Infrastructure Defense</h3>
              <p>High-confidence hardening, patch governance, and architecture choices designed for resilience.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-index">04</div>
              <h3>Executive Response</h3>
              <p>Fast, structured escalation and recovery frameworks for protecting trust and continuity.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
